Text: 4.4. Case Observation According to our observation, the enhanced model is likely to generate poems with both high quality and diversity. We present two examples generated by the model and give some comments on the meaning of each poem. 七律· 远望 江上微茫一叶舟，天涯芳草满汀洲 数声渔唱隔船过，几点人家落帆游 春色不从莺语到，夕阳空度客心愁 何时重向长桥饮，同泛溪光共白头 The example above is a Qiyan Lvshi. The title of this poem means “look far around”.

